<title>USA: Greif Bros names Chandler vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Greif Bros names Chandler vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DELAWARE, Ohio 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greif Bros. Corp said Tuesday it named Charles Chandler vice chairman.</p>
<p>Chandler previously served as president and chief operating officer of Virginia Fibre Corp, a Greif Bros. subsidiary.</p>
<p>Greif Bros., which manufactures industrial packaging and components, was not immediately available to comment on whom Chandler replaces.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
